<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Tech Deck PMO</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Tech Deck PMO — commercial operations, intake, and project delivery dashboard." />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #08111f;
        --panel: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.88);
        --text: #e2e8f0;
        --muted: #94a3b8;
        --accent: #7dd3fc;
        --accent-2: #38bdf8;
        --shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.18);
        --border: rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.22);
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;
        color: var(--text);
        background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #13243d 0%, #060b14 55%, #02060d 100%);
      }
      .shell {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 32px 20px 80px;
      }
      .nav {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }
      .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      }
      .brand-mark {
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #1d4ed8);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }
      .badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 8px 12px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.12);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        color: var(--accent);
        font-size: 0.92rem;
      }
      .hero {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
        gap: 28px;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .hero-card,
      .metric-grid,
      .feature-list,
      .cta-panel {
        background: var(--panel);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 24px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }
      .hero-card {
        padding: 36px;
      }
      .eyebrow { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-bottom: 14px; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 2.7vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.02; margin: 0 0 14px; }
      p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 1.02rem; }
      .hero-actions { margin-top: 24px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
      .primary-btn, .secondary-btn {
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 13px 18px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration: none;
        border: 1px solid transparent;
      }
      .primary-btn {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
        color: #03121f;
      }
      .secondary-btn {
        color: var(--text);
        border-color: var(--border);
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);
      }
      .hero-aside {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 18px;
      }
      .cta-panel {
        padding: 24px;
      }
      .cta-panel h2 { margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 1.2rem; }
      .metric-grid {
        padding: 20px;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 16px;
      }
      .metric {
        padding: 18px;
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
      }
      .metric strong { display: block; font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 6px; }
      .section-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr;
        gap: 20px;
        margin-top: 28px;
      }
      .feature-list {
        padding: 24px;
      }
      .feature-list ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.8; }
      .footer-note {
        margin-top: 28px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        text-align: center;
      }
      @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .hero, .section-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      }
      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .nav { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
        .hero-card { padding: 26px; }
        .metric-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="nav">
        <div class="brand">
          <div class="brand-mark"></div>
          <span>Tech Deck PMO</span>
        </div>
        <div class="badge">www.techdeckPMO.com</div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero">
        <section class="hero-card">
          <div class="eyebrow">AI-first PMO operations</div>
          <h1>Turn project delivery into a controlled revenue engine.</h1>
          <p>Tech Deck PMO brings your budget, inventory, receivables, payment timelines, and proposal-close activities into one high-clarity operating view.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="primary-btn" href="mailto:hello@techdeckpmo.com">Book a walkthrough</a>
            <a class="secondary-btn" href="https://github.com/solanofranco69-arch/Tech-Deck-PMO">View source</a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <aside class="hero-aside">
          <div class="cta-panel">
            <h2>Built for your operating rhythm</h2>
            <p>Track project stage progress, cost exposure, payment schedules, and inventory usage from one polished dashboard.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-grid">
            <div class="metric">
              <span>Cost visibility</span>
              <strong>$0.00</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="metric">
              <span>Revenue forecast</span>
              <strong>$0.00</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="metric">
              <span>Accounts receivable</span>
              <strong>$0.00</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="metric">
              <span>Installments</span>
              <strong>0 active</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <div class="section-grid">
        <section class="feature-list">
          <h2>What you can manage</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Proposal close-out checklists and approval paths</li>
            <li>Budget and spend visibility across projects</li>
            <li>Inventory adjustments and usage tracking</li>
            <li>Receivables, payment methods, and scheduled installments</li>
            <li>Client and account data captured directly in the workflow</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="cta-panel">
          <h2>Launch with confidence</h2>
          <p>Deploy the operational dashboard behind your brand and make the site your public front door for new opportunities, demos, and stakeholder updates.</p>
          <p>This page is now ready to be served through GitHub Pages and connected to your custom domain.</p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <p class="footer-note">Tech Deck PMO • Public website preview • Ready for custom domain routing</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
